{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a pure and distraction-free chess experience with <strong>Just Chess</strong>! Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, this game offers a simple and accessible way to play chess in a modern 3D setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D Chessboard -</strong> With an adjustable viewing angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to Play</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and an intuitive interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adaptive AI Strength</strong> \u2013 The AI automatically adjusts it's strength based on your wins and losses, ensuring a balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PGN Export and Analysis\u00a0</strong>- The game allows you to copy the chess game in PGN format to the clipboard and analyze it on online chess analysis websites.\u00a0Online analysis may require an account with the analysis service provider.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> \u2013 Unlock achievements as you play and test your skills.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawn Promoter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/966e9a9d01085b2e4d8cb47db68671f5a2b7f465.jpg"},{"name":"At least the pieces don't fall off the board!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/5af6c54e76105faa8716444a71e498072a81b8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Pawn's First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/25362bb65b3702683dad6f8da11e0b5b2ea16295.jpg"},{"name":"Castling Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/1ea6d30181daf685aa69bc8e71e56f2e9f685012.jpg"},{"name":"Knight Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public